    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, but a therapist just tells me to \"cope\" or \"breathe\" or whatever. it feels so pointless. like, what's the point of coping if the world is just gonna keep making it this hard? it feels like i'm just running a race that has no finish line. i'm just so done with the struggle.",
